1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:03,780
Humans must seek to be better

2
00:00:04,820 --> 00:00:06,580
Not to be the best

3
00:00:07,820 --> 00:00:08,820
Why?

4
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:10,100
Why not the best?

5
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:14,120
And in the matters of the worldly life that isn't worth competing for

6
00:00:14,120 --> 00:00:16,560
Look at who's inferior to you, to feel content and satisfied

7
00:00:17,720 --> 00:00:21,040
This is the difference between both

8
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:25,360
People should seek to become better

9
00:00:26,160 --> 00:00:28,240
Not to become the best

10
00:00:29,120 --> 00:00:31,520
Why? why not become the best?

11
00:00:31,880 --> 00:00:35,040
Because seeking this will ruin your principles

12
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:38,560
And will make you enemies, and will cause you to burn out

13
00:00:39,080 --> 00:00:41,200
And you'll belittle Allah's favors to you

14
00:00:41,360 --> 00:00:43,200
And it defies the rules of the universe

15
00:00:44,080 --> 00:00:46,600
When you seek to become The Best

16
00:00:46,880 --> 00:00:50,400
By this, you'll be competing with the destiny of the others

17
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:52,720
Not the others, because it is their destiny

18
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:54,720
This is their fate, you can't compete with that

19
00:00:54,920 --> 00:00:56,780
Rather, seek to be better, work on yourself
